WEBVTT

00:05:29.636 --> 00:05:30.796
And instead I imagined,

00:05:30.836 --> 00:05:33.116
like Doctor Strange
in "Avengers: Endgame,"

00:05:33.116 --> 00:05:34.516
with the time stone,

00:05:34.556 --> 00:05:38.116
every possible scenario and outcome,
just to prepare myself as a father.

00:05:38.156 --> 00:05:40.796
I had to emotionally prepare
for every outcome.

00:05:40.836 --> 00:05:43.116
So I used to imagine Nusayba dying.

00:05:43.516 --> 00:05:46.156
I imagined burying her with my own hands.

00:05:46.196 --> 00:05:48.676
I imagined making the phone call
to her grandparents,

00:05:48.716 --> 00:05:51.556
explaining that she had died,
listening to them cry.

00:05:51.596 --> 00:05:55.196
I imagined living the rest of my life
like a shell of a man,

00:05:55.236 --> 00:05:57.156
but pretending to put a smile on my face

00:05:57.196 --> 00:05:59.796
because I had a son to raise
and now a daughter.

00:05:59.796 --> 00:06:01.676
My wife, badass that she is,